#: config.cpp:41
msgid "Draw window frames using &titlebar colors"
msgstr "Dessiner les boirdeures des purneas avou les coleurs del båre di &tite"

#: config.cpp:43
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When selected, the window borders are drawn using the titlebar colors; "
"otherwise, they are drawn using normal border colors."
msgstr ""
"Cwand il est tchoezi, les gåliotaedjes des boirdeures des purneas sont "
"dessinêyes avou les minmès coleurs ki pol bår di tite. Ôtrumint, ele "
"sont dessinêyes avou les coleurs normåles des boirdeures"

#: config.cpp:49
msgid "Draw &resize handle"
msgstr ""

#: config.cpp:51
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab handle\" in the bottom "
"right corner of the windows; otherwise, no grab handle is drawn."
msgstr ""

#: config.cpp:56
msgid "Actions Settings"
msgstr "Apontiaedjes des accions"

#: config.cpp:58
#, fuzzy
msgid "Double click on menu button:"
msgstr "Dobe clitchaedje sol boton di menu:"

#: config.cpp:60
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Èn rén fé"

#: config.cpp:61
msgid "Minimize Window"
msgstr "Mete li purnea å pus ptit"

#: config.cpp:62
msgid "Shade Window"
msgstr "Erôler li purnea"

#: config.cpp:63
msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "Clôre li purnea"

#: config.cpp:66
msgid ""
"An action can be associated to a double click of the menu button. Leave it "
"to none if in doubt."
msgstr ""
"Ene accion pout esse associeye å dobe clitchaedje sol boton di menu. Leyîz "
"l' a nouk si vos avoz des dotances."
